        <h2 class="about-story__heading" id="about-story-heading">Our Story</h2>
        <p>Kent iPhone Repair was started by Sam, a qualified technician with over 16 years of experience in mobile phone repairs. What began as a passion for fixing devices quickly grew into one of Kent's most trusted mobile repair services.</p>
        <p>We built the business around one core belief: getting your iPhone repaired should be easy, affordable, and hassle-free. That's why we come to you - whether you're at home, at work, or anywhere else in Kent. There's no need to visit a shop, post your phone, or wait around for days.</p>
        <p>Over the years, we've completed more than 7,000 repairs across Kent, earning over 250 five-star reviews along the way. From cracked screens and dead batteries to faulty charging ports, we've seen it all - and fixed it all.</p>
